    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't think \"small steps\" or volunteering is gonna fix this. it feels deeper than that. it's like the system is designed to just drain you until there's nothing left. finding a new \"passion\" feels like just picking a different colored cage. sometimes i just wonder if the only way to actually win, or to actually have control over anything, is to just refuse to play the game at all. to just stop.",
